                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Report of the Deputies</hi></p>
                <p>The Council <hi rendition="#italic">adopted</hi> the order of items submitted by
                    the Deputies for the meeting (C.F.M. (46) 25).<anchor n="96" xml:id="d90-f1"
                    /></p>
                <pb facs="0223" n="203" xml:id="pg203"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Allied Inspectorate in Italy and
                        Treaty Commission</hi></p>
                <p>As no agreement was reached on this question, the Council passed on to the next
                    item.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Austro-Italian Frontier</hi></p>
                <p>The Council <hi rendition="#italic">adopted</hi> the proposal contained in the
                    Deputies Report to the following effect: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <list>
                            <item>“1) Having again considered the Austrian requests for the
                                rectification of the Austro-Italian frontier, the Deputies confirmed
                                that these requests do not represent minor rectifications within the
                                meaning of the decision taken by the Council of Foreign Ministers on
                                14th September 1945.</item>
                            <item>Consequently, the requests cannot be given consideration.</item>
                            <item>“2) The Austrian Government shall be officially informed of the
                                decision of 14th September 1945 and of the fact that their requests
                                are not considered consonant with that decision and can, therefore,
                                not be given consideration”.<anchor n="97" xml:id="d90-f2"/></item>
                        </list>
                    </quote></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting of the
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>The proposal contained in the Deputies Report was <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >adopted</hi>: the Deputies to meet in the afternoon at 4 p.m. in order to
                    prepare the work for the meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers on
                    Thursday, 2nd May, at 12 a.m.</p>
