                        rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d90-f2" n="97" xml:id="d90-f2-content">
                <p>The decision set forth here was communicated to the Austrian Representative
                    Bischoff in a letter from the Council of Foreign Ministers dated May 3, 1946,
                    the text of which was circulated to the Council as C.F.M. (46) 39, May 3, 1946,
                    not printed.</p>
            </note>
